{
    "title": "Pixel 4D\u2122 Live Wallpapers",
    "description": "<h3><b>Transform Your Phone with Pixel 4D - The Ultimate Live Wallpaper Experience!</b></h3>\r\n\r\nDiscover a world where your phone becomes more than just a device - it's a dynamic art piece with Pixel 4D Live Wallpapers! Over 300 stunning 3D & 4D live wallpapers and animated lock screen backgrounds are eagerly waiting to make your phone truly unique.\r\n\r\n<h3><b>\ud83c\udf1f 3D & 4D Wallpapers for Home Screen and Lock Screen!</b></h3>\r\nWhy settle for one when you can have two? With Pixel 4D, you can beautify both your home screen and lock screen simultaneously with different 3D live wallpapers. It's double the fun without any hassle!\r\n\r\n<b>Enjoy the full magic of dual live wallpapers in 3D and 4D.</b>\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udde8\ufe0f Witness the extraordinary with Pixel 4D\u2122. Your phone isn't just a phone anymore - it's a mesmerizing 3D experience with real 4D depth effects. These aren't your ordinary wallpapers; they're a battery-friendly gateway to an awe-inspiring world.\r\n\r\n<h3><b>\ud83d\ude80 Upgrade your phone using experience!</b></h3>\r\n\ud83d\udd0b Low on battery? No problem! Our wallpapers are designed to be super efficient, using less than 2% of your battery. And for those AMOLED screens, we've got special wallpapers that consume less than 0.5% battery.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd04 Feeling spontaneous? Enable the auto-changer to surprise yourself with a new live wallpaper for your lock screen or home screen daily.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0c Explore endless possibilities with fantastic categories - from anime and superheroes to nature and cars, all in stunning 4K resolution. Discover why our Live Wallpaper 3D Moving feature is the ultimate way to personalize your device!\r\n\r\n<h3><b>\ud83c\udf1f Personalize your phone easily with cool wallpapers!</b></h3>\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Make your phone a reflection of you. Use our search engine to find the perfect live wallpaper and enjoy the incredible 4D depth effect as you tilt your device. Use 3D Live Wallpaper free and enjoy a variety of categories of moving backgrounds.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf9b\ufe0f Customize to your heart's content. Adjust the effects strength and set the battery saving mode to keep your phone running smoothly.\r\n\r\n<h3><b>\u2728 Pixel 4D - Live Wallpapers:</b></h3>\r\n\u2705 Dual wallpaper capability for lock screen and home screen.\r\n\u2705 Ultra-wide support for all screen types.\r\n\u2705 Eye-catching 3D holograms and backgrounds.\r\n\u2705 Wide range of categories.\r\n\u2705 Battery-friendly choices.\r\n\u2705 Continuously updated collection.\r\n\u2705 Built-in search engine.\r\n\u2705 Full customization options.\r\n\u2705 Exclusive AMOLED themes.\r\n\ud83d\ude80 Ready to upgrade your phone experience? Choose Pixel 4D\u2122 - where 3D is great, but 4D is simply awesome! Plus, enjoy many free options included.\r\n\r\n<h3><b>\ud83c\udf1f Make the switch to Pixel 4D Live Wallpapers today and never look back at a boring phone screen again! </b></h3>",
    "descriptionHTML": "<h3><b>Transform Your Phone with Pixel 4D - The Ultimate Live Wallpaper Experience!</b></h3><br><br>Discover a world where your phone becomes more than just a device - it&#39;s a dynamic art piece with Pixel 4D Live Wallpapers! Over 300 stunning 3D &amp; 4D live wallpapers and animated lock screen backgrounds are eagerly waiting to make your phone truly unique.<br><br><h3><b>\ud83c\udf1f 3D &amp; 4D Wallpapers for Home Screen and Lock Screen!</b></h3><br>Why settle for one when you can have two? With Pixel 4D, you can beautify both your home screen and lock screen simultaneously with different 3D live wallpapers. It&#39;s double the fun without any hassle!<br><br><b>Enjoy the full magic of dual live wallpapers in 3D and 4D.</b><br><br>\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udde8\ufe0f Witness the extraordinary with Pixel 4D\u2122. Your phone isn&#39;t just a phone anymore - it&#39;s a mesmerizing 3D experience with real 4D depth effects. These aren&#39;t your ordinary wallpapers; they&#39;re a battery-friendly gateway to an awe-inspiring world.<br><br><h3><b>\ud83d\ude80 Upgrade your phone using experience!</b></h3><br>\ud83d\udd0b Low on battery? No problem! Our wallpapers are designed to be super efficient, using less than 2% of your battery. And for those AMOLED screens, we&#39;ve got special wallpapers that consume less than 0.5% battery.<br><br>\ud83d\udd04 Feeling spontaneous? Enable the auto-changer to surprise yourself with a new live wallpaper for your lock screen or home screen daily.<br><br>\ud83c\udf0c Explore endless possibilities with fantastic categories - from anime and superheroes to nature and cars, all in stunning 4K resolution. Discover why our Live Wallpaper 3D Moving feature is the ultimate way to personalize your device!<br><br><h3><b>\ud83c\udf1f Personalize your phone easily with cool wallpapers!</b></h3><br>\ud83d\udd0d Make your phone a reflection of you. Use our search engine to find the perfect live wallpaper and enjoy the incredible 4D depth effect as you tilt your device. Use 3D Live Wallpaper free and enjoy a variety of categories of moving backgrounds.<br><br>\ud83c\udf9b\ufe0f Customize to your heart&#39;s content. Adjust the effects strength and set the battery saving mode to keep your phone running smoothly.<br><br><h3><b>\u2728 Pixel 4D - Live Wallpapers:</b></h3><br>\u2705 Dual wallpaper capability for lock screen and home screen.<br>\u2705 Ultra-wide support for all screen types.<br>\u2705 Eye-catching 3D holograms and backgrounds.<br>\u2705 Wide range of categories.<br>\u2705 Battery-friendly choices.<br>\u2705 Continuously updated collection.<br>\u2705 Built-in search engine.<br>\u2705 Full customization options.<br>\u2705 Exclusive AMOLED themes.<br>\ud83d\ude80 Ready to upgrade your phone experience? Choose Pixel 4D\u2122 - where 3D is great, but 4D is simply awesome! Plus, enjoy many free options included.<br><br><h3><b>\ud83c\udf1f Make the switch to Pixel 4D Live Wallpapers today and never look back at a boring phone screen again! </b></h3>",
